    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>USER_GUIDE</label><div><h5>OVERVIEW</h5><ul><li>START_PAGE_WITH_SEARCH,_FAVORITES,_TO-DO,_NOTES,_WEATHER,_NEWS.</li><li>ALL_LOCAL:_DATA_STAYS_IN_YOUR_BROWSER_(LOCALSTORAGE).</li></ul><h5>SHORTCUTS</h5><ul><li>CTRL/CMD+K:_OPEN_COMMAND_PALETTE</li><li>1-9:_OPEN_FIRST_9_FAVORITES_(WHEN_NOT_TYPING)</li><li>/_:_FOCUS_SEARCH_(ALSO_VIA_PALETTE)</li><li>ENTER_IN_SEARCH:_START_SEARCH</li><li>ESC:_CLOSE_MODALS</li><li>PALETTE:_QUICK_ACTIONS_FOR_WIDGETS,_THEME,_BACKGROUND,_DATA,_FAVORITES</li><li>PALETTE:_KEY_C_SWITCHES_CARD_STYLE,_\"RESET_HEADER_COLORS\"_RESETS_SEARCH_&_CLOCK</li></ul><h5>SEARCH_&_AUTOCOMPLETE</h5><ul><li>BANGS:_!g_!ddg_!bing_!yt_!wiki_!maps</li><li>CUSTOM_SHORTCUTS:_JSON_IN_SETTINGS;_{q}_AS_PLACEHOLDER</li><li>AUTOCOMPLETE:_BANGS,_SHORTCUTS,_RECENT_SEARCHES,_WORDLIST_(GLOBAL_+_PRESET)</li><li>TAB_ACCEPTS_SUGGESTION,_ENTER_STARTS_SEARCH</li></ul><h5>TILES</h5><ul><li>DRAG_&_DROP_TO_SORT,_CLICK_TO_OPEN</li><li>+_TILE:_ADD_A_NEW_FAVORITE</li><li>RESET:_RESTORE_DEFAULT_FAVORITES</li></ul><h5>WIDGETS_&_LAYOUT</h5><ul><li>VISIBILITY_PER_WIDGET</li><li>CARD_STYLE_IS_GLOBAL_(GLASS,_SOLID,_TRANSPARENT,_SOFT_MINIMAL)</li><li>CUSTOM_COLORS_FOR_CLOCK/SEARCH;_RESET_RESTORES_STYLE_DEFAULTS</li><li>WIDGET_COLORS_&_\"TINT_WIDGETS\"_SET_THE_ACCENT_PER_CARD</li></ul><h5>BACKGROUND</h5><ul><li>PRESETS,_UPLOADS,_COLLECTIONS,_ROTATION_(TIME/THEME/INTERVAL)</li><li>ACCENT_COLOR_IS_EXTRACTED_FROM_THE_ACTIVE_BACKGROUND</li></ul><h5>DATA</h5><ul><li>EXPORT/IMPORT_AS_JSON</li><li>LOAD_DATA_PRESETS_(ASSETS/PRESETS/*.JSON_IN_THE_REPO)</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
